  "description": "DICOMweb (PS3.18) server building blocks for ASP.NET Core on DicomKit: app.MapDicomWeb() maps QIDO-RS (with sequence matching), WADO-RS (instances, metadata, frames, bulk data, rendered images and thumbnails, decompression to uncompressed transfer syntaxes), STOW-RS (Part 10 or JSON / XML metadata plus bulk data), the UPS-RS Worklist service and a WADL capabilities resource as minimal-API endpoints over a pluggable IDicomWebStore, with streaming multipart, content negotiation and request size limits. Includes in-memory and file-system reference stores. Requires a license key: free Developer key for development and testing, Pro / Enterprise plans for production (https://dicomkit.plogic.dev).",
